OL,3,A'Retracing Jay's steps has given more
OL,4,Aclosure'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of Jay Slater, who died
OL,7,Fafter he went missing in Tenerife, has
OL,8,Fsaid retracing his footsteps was "very
OL,9,Ftough and emotional" but had given her
OL,10,F"more closure".
OL,12,FJay, 19, and from Oswaldtwistle in
OL,13,FLancashire, went missing on 17 June
OL,14,F2024 after attending a music festival
OL,15,Fin Playa de las Americas on the Spanish
OL,16,Fisland, and was found dead after a
OL,17,F29-day search.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
