OL,3,A'Retracing Jay's steps has given more
OL,4,Aclosure'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis mother, Debbie Duncan, told BBC
OL,7,FRadio Lancashire she hoped after
OL,8,Fwatching a forthcoming documentary on
OL,9,Fthe case, people "may well believe the
OL,10,Ffacts".
OL,12,FThe first episode of the Channel Five
OL,13,Fseries "Cause of Death", which will
OL,14,Fexplore the manhunt and huge social
OL,15,Fmedia interest around the case, will
OL,16,Fair at 21:00 BST on Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
